# Local 360 originals — the site loads them from Cloudflare R2 in production.
# GitHub Pages has a 100 MB per-file limit and a ~1 GB soft repo limit;
# these images total ~800 MB, so they don't belong in the repo.
# Keep them in place locally for offline reference and future ffmpeg work.
images/*.jpg
images/*.JPG
images/*.jpeg
images/*.JPEG
images/*.png
